    schema:reviewBody "Home of D'julz Bass Culture, Gilb'R Versatile and Damian Lazarus Crosstown Rebels Paris residencies" ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r11 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "c'est chôôô la techno ?" ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r12 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "best sound system in town" ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r13 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "the music is good and the environment is also good.this club is the best compare to club in my country" ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r14 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "L'un des plus célèbre club parisien depuis déjà plusieurs générations. C'est ici que la rédaction vous présentera grâce à une résidence annuelle, leurs coups de coeur musicaux." ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r15 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "One of the best" ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r16 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Cet établissement est signataire de la charte Fêtez Clairs: tu peux y trouver des préservatifs, des éthylotests, des bouchons d'oreilles et des documents de prévention http://www.fetez-clairs.org" ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r17 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Rex’s muscle in the city is unavoidable. Ugly beast it may be, but Rex still reaches club-land levels close to legendary institutions like Fabric in London or Berghain in Berlin." ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r18 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Here everyone still thrashes around at the end of every week. The musical word is preached by a horde of resident DJs, new artistes and distinguished guests. The capital’s temple to electro." ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r19 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "une legende du paris night life" ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r20 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Absolutely, a great venue you don't want to miss if you like to club all around the world. Good music n quality sound in the most friendly and relaxed atmosphere possible. Good job." ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r21 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Always a good night: casual place with great music. Great for your 2nd stop. Try to arrive after 3:30 to avoid queues. Don't worry you will have plenty of time to dance, open until morning." ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r22 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "150€ = a bottle + a table + 4 covers + unlimited softs. Good deal. Awesome music." ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r23 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Great music and people! Paris, Paris :))))" ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r24 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "La boite est cool, et les consos sont abordables. La clientèle reste moyenne et cela dépend des soirées." ;
    schema:about place:83448 .

review:83448_r25 a schema:Review ;
