review:83499_r0 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Ne pas rater les lovelockers, cadenas comme promesse d'eternité." ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r1 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The Pont des Arts or Passerelle des Arts is a pedestrian bridge in Paris which crosses the Seine River. It links the Institut de France and the central square (cour carrée) of the palais du Louvre, (w" ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r2 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "À l'image d'un jardin suspendu, ce pont est un lieu de détente. La vue donne sue l'Île de la Cité ou la Tour Eiffel. Et ne manquez pas les cadenas d'amour... Avant de déguster un pique-nique." ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r3 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Paris / Good place to hang out with friends, where also the Parisians meet. Bring a bottle of french wine and enjoy the romantic view: Seine, Eiffel-Tower, Louvre." ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r4 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Don't forget to bring your dedicated Lovelock and throw the key into the Seine." ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r5 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Poser votre cadenas d'amour comme le veut la tradition. Un lieu beaucoup moins romantique de nuit mais très festif !" ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r6 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Pic-nic ou  apéro sur le Pont des Arts. Très sympa en été" ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r7 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "This bridge has been featured in every single pictures, videos or movies about Paris. These days you can bring a lock and attach it. Awesome pictures of locks, couples and the Seine river." ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r8 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Parfait pour un picnic les soirs de printemps!" ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r9 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The bridge for the lovers! Take a padlock with you, write your name + lover on it, and you will be happy with this person forever. Just throw the key on the canal! Beautiful. In the back of Louvre." ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r10 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Nice place  to do with your lover...don't forget your lock !!!" ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r11 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "this is the most lovely bridge in Paris!! cant ever miss" ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r12 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Apportez votre cadenas de l'Amour avant de venir!" ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r13 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Le lieu romantique pour les amoureux ! :)" ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r14 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "After admiring the Cour Carré du Louvre, home to our défilés and the mysterious departure of l’Invitation au Voyage, seal your love by attaching a padlock to the railing of this romantic bridge." ;
    schema:about place:83499 .

review:83499_r15 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Une promenade classique qui ne perd jamais de son charme ! Vous en profiterez pour admirer la multitude de cadenas attachés, symbole de l’amour éternel." ;
