    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Les Halles is one of worst place in Paris, but this UGC theater is one of bigger in the world by visitors.I prefer the UGC Bercy it's just at few stops of Les Halles and there is a better atmosphere" ;
