review:84063_r3 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The best gay bar in Le Marais @ Paris, pleasant atmosphere, fast service and delicious cocktails ! ♥ Be sure to be there the day there is a striptease show you will not be disappointed. :P" ;
    schema:about place:84063 .

review:84063_r4 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Cet établissement est signataire de la charte Fêtez Clairs: tu peux y trouver des préservatifs, des éthylotests, des bouchons d'oreilles et des documents de prévention http://www.fetez-clairs.org" ;
    schema:about place:84063 .

review:84063_r5 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "I believe this bar closes the latest in the district. Smoking room downstairs." ;
    schema:about place:84063 .

review:84063_r6 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Beware: The bar man at the bar downstairs may try the change-money trick on you, eg you owe him €6 for your drink, you give him a €20-bill and he may return just €4. Fucking idiot! #fail" ;
    schema:about place:84063 .

review:84063_r7 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "And no, I didn't fall for it as this is an old and still commonly used trick by bar men at some places in Paris. Always verify the money you give to those fuckers and calculate your change. It's fraud" ;
    schema:about place:84063 .

review:84063_r8 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The shower dance is especially spicy. Barmen pretend not to understand English so you need to really articulate what you want." ;
    schema:about place:84063 .

