review:84857_r0 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Pont de l'Alma (Alma Bridge in English) is an arch bridge in Paris, crossing the Seine. It was named to commemorate the Battle of Alma during the Crimean War, in which the Franco-British alliance achi" ;
