    schema:reviewBody "l'Avenue Principale through the main gates. Turn right on l'Avenue du Puits Turn right on Ch. Serre, Turn left on Ch. Maison,Turn left on Ch. Lauriston.  He is tucked behind a couple of graves" ;
    schema:about place:85417 .

