review:85777_r0 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "A shining terrace on the roof of the department store. Restaurant run by the Chief Fumiko Kono with a wonderful menu." ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r1 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Endroit idéal pour déjeuner au soleil face à la capitale ! Great place for a (business) lunch with magnificent view of Paris!" ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r2 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Sunny day? Buy some staff and enjoy the view sitting at the terrace." ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r3 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Cuisine fraiche et légère - je recommande la Focaccia - du chef japonais Fumiko Kono, servie avec un magnifique panorama de la capitale." ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r4 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The discreet cafeteria at Galeries Lafayette was transformed into a gourmet restaurant last summer. Up on the eighth floor, the place feels like the upper deck of a yacht." ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r5 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Up on the eighth floor, the place feels like the upper deck of a yacht, all in dark wood sheltered under a canopy of light-coloured cotton, with a long, streamlined counter." ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r6 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Uw vrouw achterlaten en dan in de bar een wijntje gaan vragen en op het zevende verdiep schoentjes uit en in het zonnetje liggen!" ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r7 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Since 2011, Roland Garros organizes animations on the roof of the Galeries Lafayettes during the tournament. An incredible experience if you love Paris and/or Roland Garros !" ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r8 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Pendant le tournoi de Roland Garros (fin mai-début juin), la FFT organise des animations avec les meilleures joueurs/joueuses du monde sur les toits des Galeries Lafayettes !" ;
    schema:about place:85777 .

review:85777_r9 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "After taking a look at all the expensive things at Galeries Lafayette, you wont believe how tall and big this place is. Up on the eighth floor, the terrace feels like the upper deck of a yacht." ;
