review:86115_r2 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Created at the beginning of the 12th century, it was then the central point of the University of Paris ; students met, listened to teachers, partied and fought there" ;
    schema:about place:86115 .

review:86115_r3 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Nous sommes en 1860, rue des Noyers, non loin de la Place Maubert,  le fantôme d’un chiffonnier du quartier, un certain Jeannet frappe une maison voisine de morceaux de bûche à demi carbonisée." ;
    schema:about place:86115 .

review:86115_r4 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "So many places to eat here in addition to a street market with lots of fresh fruits and veggies. There is also a really cool American bar here if you are looking for a little slice of the homeland." ;
    schema:about place:86115 .

