review:89500_r0 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Go to the fitness room on 12th floor for a view of Eiffel Tower" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r1 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "El peor y mas caro gin Tonic que he tomado, 15€ en un minúsculo vaso de tubo casi sin hielo y con muchísima Ginebra." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r2 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Don't ask for a Gin & tonic as they have no idea how to serve it: thin glass, thick wedge of lemon and practically all gin. Oh and to top it all, 15€ for the privilege." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r3 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Service is 4* breakfast too but hotel itself is more like 3.5*. Comfy beds but toilet and bathroom are separate and space is an issue. Lifts don't always work and bar is poor. Staff faultless." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r4 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Гостиница в 5 минутах от эйфелевой башни, бесплатный интернет, номера на 3+, room service откликается на все просьбы достаточно быстро" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r5 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "отличный отель, в 2х шагах от башни!   тихо, уютно. халявный вайфай Orange :))" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r6 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Elle est là @ayu_19980408 Mercure Paris Centre Tour Eiffel https://twitter.com/ayu_19980408/status/268282242936209408" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r7 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Great hotel to stay at... Especially for the price. Room we stayed in didn't have a view of the Eiffel tower, but then again we were never in the room! Staff was extremely nice!" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r8 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Nice hotel with clean and descent rooms.. Near the Eiffel Tower and the Metro!" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r9 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Zachte kussens" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r10 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Excelente, acolhedor. Voltarei com certeza...." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r11 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Best view on the \"dame de fer\"? Go to the 12th floor all the way to the end of the corridor. There is a window rIght next to the ice machine... enjoy!" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r12 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Take time to enjoy the tiny gym on the 12th floor. You can work out looking at the Eiffel Tower. Then when done head on over and get a Crepe." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r13 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Mediocre tourist trap. Great location, but everything is expensive, staff not so helpful." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r14 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Rever Paris é sempre um prazer! Os franceses ao contrário do que se costuma dizer, são sempre solícitos e super , mega simpáticos!" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r15 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Reencontrando Paris..... Ao contrario do que dizem , os franceses continuam solícitos e super, mega adoráveis !!!!!!!!" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r16 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Muito bom. E a localização melhor ainda. Ao lado da Torre Eiffel." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r17 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "O hotel tem uma localização privilegiada, mas é caro e o quarto é pequeno." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r18 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Its very nice. Near the Eiffel Tower" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r19 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "There is an ice machine and water dispenser on the 12th floor! Crucial for getting your champers on ice before a picnic under the Eiffel Tower!" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r20 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The location is great, people are very helpful, but room service could be better. They don't take the garbage away, we had to ask for it." ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

review:89500_r21 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Unas vistas preciosas desde la habitación. Very nice view from the rooms, the staff is very friendly" ;
    schema:about place:89500 .

