review:90304_r0 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "New cocktail bar in town ;)" ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r1 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Great place! Be sure to stop in. The wait staff are top notch and very friendly." ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r2 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "They have a unique selection of 5-6 beers, so that \"i hate cocktails\" friend can come along and find something good to drink as well." ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r3 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Granny's Old Pipe and Belle en Bulle are a win, Goldenight is pleasure to your eyes only (the pic)! And for food, Tartine burrata's a must! Pata Negra's Heaven! Enjoy this cosy place like I did ;)" ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r4 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Amazing, simply amazing. Get whatever sounds good, and it will be!" ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r5 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Bar intimiste. Amaury le barman est un spécialiste du \"Omakase\" (cocktail sur-mesure adapté à son humeur). Cocktails entre 12 et 13€. Ouvert : mardi au samedi (18h-2h), dimanche et lundi (20h à 2h)." ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r6 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Excellente sélection whisky - plateau de 4 verres différents à faire soi-même pour environ 28€. Le cocktail Lampone di modena est à tomber. En revanche niveau son/Dj c'est pas encore ça..." ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r7 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Sullivan Doh created \"Doquiri\" to compete at the Diplomático Tournament: France, adding Orange bitters, Champagne Syrup and Diplomático Blanco. Simply amazing" ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r8 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Ici, la spécialité est le cocktail, mais surtout le whisky ! Les amateurs de scotch l’auront compris grâce au nom." ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r9 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Great cocktails, airy space and smells like a bar...in a good way!" ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r10 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "A tester : le \"frangipane\" et le \"belle en bulle\" :)" ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r11 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Demander un weird essential martini à Simon. Hors de la carte et terriblement bon !" ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r12 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Ben Nevis 19y, wonderful." ;
    schema:about place:90304 .

review:90304_r13 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Ambiance cosy et intimiste, bons cocktails et personnel accueillant. Une bonne adresse !" ;
